OL,3,GNEWSASheffield music 'really healthy'
OL,4,Asays Cabaret Voltaire veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of Sheffield music looks
OL,7,F"really healthy", one of Cabaret
OL,8,FVoltaire's founding members has said
OL,9,Fafter winding up the band's 50-year
OL,10,Fcareer in the city.
OL,12,FChris Watson joined fellow founder
OL,13,FStephen Mallinder at the city's Octagon
OL,14,FCentre on Sunday night to complete
OL,15,Ftheir UK-wide tour and finish where
OL,16,Fthey had started in the mid-1970s.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
