OL,3,GNEWSASheffield music 'really healthy'
OL,4,Asays Cabaret Voltaire veteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sold-out homecoming marks the end
OL,7,Fof a band that was at the forefront of
OL,8,Fa revolution in popular music, which
OL,9,Fsaw musicians turn away from guitars
OL,10,Ftowards wire-sprouting modular
OL,11,Fsynthesisers and bedroom laptops.
OL,13,FSpeaking to the BBC after the show,
OL,14,FWatson said there was "a really good
OL,15,Fatmosphere" at the Octagon with "a lot
OL,16,Fof love in the room".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
